== Usage ==

This template displays a simple adjacent stations table for use in station article infoboxes. It does not require Lua modules.

=== Parameters ===

Up to 10 lines can be displayed. For each line ''n'' (1–10):

* <code>left''n''</code> — the preceding station (displayed on the left)
* <code>line''n''</code> — the line or service name (displayed in the centre)
* <code>right''n''</code> — the following station (displayed on the right)

If <code>left''n''</code> is empty, the row is not displayed.

=== Example ===

<pre>
{{Adjstn
| left1 = Nagaokakyō | line1 = '''JR West''' Kyoto Line | right1 = Shimamoto
| left2 = Termius    | line2 = '''JR East''' Hokuriku  | right2 = Kanazawa
}}
</pre>

